# SBP AirCare — Docker build context = this folder (deploy/compose.yaml: context ..). Deny everything, then allow only
# what deploy/Dockerfile copies. internal/ (special/project rates), tests/, tools/, backoffice/, docs (*.md), dist/,
# node_modules/, data/ and .env files never enter the build context.
*
!package.json
!server/
!assets/
!a.html
!b.html
!c.html
!d.html
!a2.html
!b2.html
!c2.html
!d2.html
!a3.html
!b3.html
!c3.html
!backoffice.html
!privacy.html
!terms.html
!refund.html
!404.html

# never, even inside the allowed folders
**/*.md
**/*.txt
**/README*
**/.*
**/*.py
assets/photos/photos.json
